    <string name="pinning_dialog_title">About app pinning</string>
    <string name="pinning_dialog_message">With Lock the app on, Little Videos asks Android to pin it each time the video grid opens. Tap Pin, or Got it, on the prompt. While pinned, the home and recent apps buttons and the notification shade do nothing, and back never leaves the grid.\n\nTo stop a child unpinning it, open the device Settings and find App pinning (under Security, Security and privacy, or Lock screen). Turn on the option to ask for a PIN or lock pattern before unpinning.\n\nTo leave the app, use Exit Little Videos here, or follow the on-screen unpin gesture and enter your device PIN.</string>

